1
00:00:00,241 --> 00:00:02,661
MRS. KOOTHRAPPALI: What are we
supposed to say to Lalita's parents?

2
00:00:02,827 --> 00:00:05,577
(Dr Koothrappali:)I play golf with her father.
I won't be able to look at him.

3
00:00:05,746 --> 00:00:08,746
(Raj:)Maybe you should keep
your eye on the ball, Papa.

4
00:00:08,916 --> 00:00:13,086
Oh, now you're a funnyman?
This is not funny, Mr. Funnyman.

5
00:00:13,254 --> 00:00:17,464
Dr. and Mrs. Koothrappali, in all fairness,
it wasn't entirely Raj's fault.

6
00:00:17,633 --> 00:00:20,133
- This is a family matter, Sheldon.
- No, I'm Leonard.

7
00:00:20,386 --> 00:00:23,266
(Dr Koothrappali:)Oh. Sorry. You all look alike to us.

8
00:00:24,849 --> 00:00:26,269
(Raj:)But he's right, Papa. Listen to him.

9
00:00:26,434 --> 00:00:27,724
[DOOR OPENS]

10
00:00:27,893 --> 00:00:30,023
You, you are the one
who ruined everything.

11
00:00:30,187 --> 00:00:31,767
(Mrs Koothrappali:)Who is it? We can't see.

12
00:00:31,939 --> 00:00:33,359
(Dr Koothrappali:)Turn us. Turn us.

13
00:00:36,485 --> 00:00:39,445
(Raj:)Go ahead, tell my parents why
they won't have any grandchildren.

14
00:00:39,822 --> 00:00:42,952
How would I know?
Do you have a low sperm count?

15
00:00:44,493 --> 00:00:46,623
(Raj:)This has nothing to do
with my sperm count.

16
00:00:46,787 --> 00:00:49,457
(Mrs Koothrappali:)You are wearing the boxers
that we sent you, aren't you?

17
00:00:49,623 --> 00:00:50,663
(Raj:)Yes, Mommy.

18
00:00:50,833 --> 00:00:54,463
(Mrs Koothrappali:)You know what happens to the samosas
when you wear the tighty whities.

19
00:00:55,463 --> 00:00:57,633
(Raj:)Can we please stop talking
about my testicles?

20
00:00:58,215 --> 00:01:01,025
(Raj:)- Sheldon, tell them what you did.
- What did I do?

